  "description": "Club de Nuit Bling by Armaf delivers a bold, radiant scent with a modern, luxurious character. It opens bright with fresh citrus top notes, giving a sparkling, energetic first impression. The heart introduces a “flower prism” and airy stardust-like freshness — clean, luminous, and slightly floral. The dry-down settles into smooth velvet woods and a hint of vanilla, wrapping the wearer in a warm, refined woody-vanilla base that balances freshness and sophistication. Bling is crafted for those who want a confident, attention-grabbing scent with both freshness and sensual depth.",
